      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "And by the way, it is also difficult to build and check each and every avatar uploaded in the past when we learn about optimization later.\n\nI think it would be useful to display the performance rank and download size on the avatar list so that we can check what avatars are bad.",
