  "details": "The performance rank display in website is very convenient feature so I'm very happy to see it!\n\nAnd I also want to check the download size in the website etc. because I have to launch the VRChat app to check it now. (We cannot check it by the SDK control panel.)\n\nAlso it is good to display the detail of performance rank, that is the polygons and skinned meshes etc.\n\nMore over, I sometimes check my avatar's bottleneck of the download size by [AssetBundleStat](https://vsk.lox9973.com/abstat/). It requires the Build & Test so it is not so convenient now. It may be happy to add the graph by AssetBundleStat in the avatar page in the website, that might help find the bottleneck.",
